    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Treats agents as organisational assets stored in statecraft and pushed to OPC via the duplex channel (spec 087 §5.3). Workspaces author, version, and govern agent definitions in the web UI; connected OPC instances receive them as a workspace-scoped catalog that local SQLite caches. The local `.claude/agents/` path remains available as a fallback for offline/personal agents; the authoritative catalog is remote. Documents the decision to keep model API keys on OPC machines.\n",
    "title": "Org-managed Agent Catalog Synced from Statecraft to OPC"
